// LSASS Dump via comsvcs.dll MiniDump
// Detects the living-off-the-land LSASS dump that calls MiniDump inside comsvcs.dll through rundll32, avoiding procdump and mimikatz binaries entirely. The ordinal form is the usual giveaway.
// techniques: T1003.001   severity: critical   status: stable
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1003.001
//   rundll32.exe C:\Windows\System32\comsvcs.dll, MiniDump <lsass_pid> C:\Windows\Temp\l.dmp full
// source: rules/credential-access/lsass-dump-comsvcs.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where (((NewProcessName endswith "\\rundll32.exe") and (CommandLine contains "comsvcs")) and ((CommandLine contains "MiniDump" or CommandLine contains "#24")))
